# Restore procedure:
# 1. Install Hermes (git clone hermes-agent repo, run setup)
# 2. Extract archive: cat *.part* > hermes_backup_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.tar.gz
# 3. Verify: sha256sum -c hermes_backup_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.tar.gz.sha256
# 4. Unpack: tar -xzf hermes_backup_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.tar.gz -C /home/echo/
# 5. Chown: chown -R hermes:hermes /home/echo/.hermes /home/echo/.mempalace
# 6. Install mempalace-venv: python3 -m venv && pip install mempalace
# 7. Start gateways — state.db rebuilds automatically
